    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Eva's Hook&quot;</strong> is a 2.5D platformer that tests your precision and reflexes through a series of challenging levels. Follow Eva on her journey to break free from the icy prison that holds her, armed only with her trusty grappling hook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created entirely by a solo indie developer, this game is a tribute to pure gameplay \u2013 no frills, no intrusive storytelling. It's just you, your mouse, and your ability to master precise movement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude9d <strong>Intuitive Grappling Hook Mechanic</strong> \u2013 Move swiftly and accurately with a mouse-controlled grappling system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Tight Platforming</strong> \u2013 Perfect for players who love technical challenges. Every jump and swing counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Collect and Explore</strong> \u2013 Gather coins scattered throughout the levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Multiple Game Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign</strong> \u2013 Traverse 6 core levels and unlock 3 bonus levels with evolving challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun Mode</strong> \u2013 Race against the clock by selecting levels and aiming for the fastest times.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Dynamic Events</strong> \u2013 Experience unexpected shifts that will test and reshape your approach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Three Difficulty Levels</strong> \u2013 Whether you're here for a casual run or a hardcore challenge, there's a mode for you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Eva's Hook&quot; won't tell you an elaborate story, but it will offer hours of engaging gameplay. By the end of this adventure, when Eva finally shatters her icy prison, it will be thanks to your skill.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Eva's Hook&quot;</strong> is a 2.5D platformer that tests your precision and reflexes through a series of challenging levels. Follow Eva on her journey to break free from the icy prison that holds her, armed only with her trusty grappling hook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created entirely by a solo indie developer, this game is a tribute to pure gameplay \u2013 no frills, no intrusive storytelling. It's just you, your mouse, and your ability to master precise movement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude9d <strong>Intuitive Grappling Hook Mechanic</strong> \u2013 Move swiftly and accurately with a mouse-controlled grappling system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Tight Platforming</strong> \u2013 Perfect for players who love technical challenges. Every jump and swing counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Collect and Explore</strong> \u2013 Gather coins scattered throughout the levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Multiple Game Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign</strong> \u2013 Traverse 6 core levels and unlock 3 bonus levels with evolving challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun Mode</strong> \u2013 Race against the clock by selecting levels and aiming for the fastest times.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Dynamic Events</strong> \u2013 Experience unexpected shifts that will test and reshape your approach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Three Difficulty Levels</strong> \u2013 Whether you're here for a casual run or a hardcore challenge, there's a mode for you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Eva's Hook&quot; won't tell you an elaborate story, but it will offer hours of engaging gameplay. By the end of this adventure, when Eva finally shatters her icy prison, it will be thanks to your skill.</p>",
